    "reviewer": "codex-primary-controller",
    "classification": "UN June 2025 notes pp. 198–199 and the October 2026 CPC3 row 1861 include unworked or simply prepared bones. WCO HS 05.06 distinguishes bones and bone powder/waste; this PCR selects only the raw bone supply. EU Regulation 1069/2009 article 10(a) explains how parts initially eligible for food may be redirected for commercial reasons. Country, source, designation and applicable authority require actual records. No assumption of lawful classification solely from slaughter eligibility.",
    "primary_evidence": "Meat & Livestock Australia’s V.RMH.2402 industry study distinguishes boning-room and slaughter-floor outputs and their multiple destinations, including raw bones going to rendering. Akiolis identifies a real collection interface and separate bones marketed for food gelatine. Those cases document alternatives, not one matching carcass, supplier or lot. No national production number, yield, chemical composition or generic cold-chain value enters the method. Historical BREF and EIC source leads were excluded where primary text was not verified.",
    "measurement": "Reference Q is the as-supplied wet net mass newly first released, including same-cohort stock still held. Incoming stocks, rejects and already-released returns retain original identity and per-exchange burden. Actual release, dispatch, joint slaughter or cutting allocation and later storage or handling are distinct. Subdivide exclusive operations, use supported causal drivers, and limit economic allocation to residual joint burdens at the common processing gate. Preserve actual borne moisture, tissue, handling losses and stocks. Normalize the attributed numerator once to its own original Qc; with no qualifying output retain the actual balances. Distinguish first non-purchased packages from traceable returns, and isolate empty or discarded container movements.",
    "native_records": "The reference Product/Mass record explicitly contains unworked or simply prepared bones. Use that broad native identity only with the specific bovine lot, nonfood destination, physical state and release constraints. A discard is a separate Waste. Actual low-voltage supply carries Net calorific value whereas metering uses Energy. The cold freight service uses mass × distance, group reference kg·km; 1 t·km is 1,000 kg·km and its screening-distance example must not become foreground data. The ammonia Product may cover supplied refrigerant makeup but cannot represent a leak, decomposition or a waste. Separate site records for quantities, provider and condition remain required.",
    "readiness": "Fifty-four inventory cards per language, 27 bound and 27 with unresolved native flow identities. Independent pcr:check performed 273 checks, skipped zero and reported 48 warnings. Candidate/authored and Chinese aligned. Actual release, safety/receiver eligibility and complete provider evidence, independent scientific review and formal translation review remain outstanding.",
